      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c5737bab85a31c5c1b6916ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このラインもひだも\r\n踊ったときに映えるんですよね♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "26888f27a7dca902f04b87899f471a4e8f73d59fa29ac18414e30e0eb6f14228",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:954aafb7382facb1bde88fb6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "遊び心をたっぷりに\r\n未知へと進む『わたし』を表現したんです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd0895d028376eb68708dfc877d425a86103c3a7242cf6c21e18d26f5eb52bba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d060549b51285f95988d180",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "清潔感がありますよね。\r\n実は汚れにくい材質なんです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf96db2f1d15586356204b33d272ac7cd58a79bc314b872eeb7f948a2675c137",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97bb6110d38ba2f36076ed0a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "丁寧な縫製は着る人のことを\r\n考えてのこと…尊敬です。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d412218ae5181265c4d5df014b5bcb099205aa6c08c836baf5370a036cadf0d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:55bb3036883bb85375258086",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "見る人はこの『わたし』を\r\nどんなふうにとらえるんでしょう？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e0e173c2b9b74b25d513cddfab935a4507a6badb8e12a2ef81f322974aa4fdf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:303c94337745c385c09e1b7f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どんな服も活かせるような\r\n着こなしを♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "a472b888196a6defafdc381c0afbf84c7fc187cd63f1b11380530fa8018a57c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1629f758e8d5a60e7f2929a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "着替えるたびに、\r\nワクワクしちゃいます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b7309af94fb72dbc6dfcf3fcf0292297cf6c032eafa5811ad6c687d9e855e15",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
