      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7f450a809199e40bda6c9a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お疲れさまです",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dbe6383c3cb7e0c632e2d7584ca291cdc7fcd493f936c1caeff6f5ca6323ea5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd2040468ef46f08917de5b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おはようございます！\r\n今日の気分に合わせたコーデ、\r\nいっしょに考えませんか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9ca2d175269d4f8aee5da3b9f518758a4ce1805e9ea695edf2969eb8a539110",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fb8187ceb5e7cbcc99e4983",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "バクシンオーちゃんの朝の挨拶を\r\n聞くと、背筋がピンッとします。\r\n彼女はいつも元気をくれますね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be3cecdfb437a85c2170aaa57ad6a5b4d5dce4baf7993dadf312a50a608899b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e551e305e4748b60b569813a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以前お姉ちゃんから聞いたレシピ…\r\nお弁当箱においしさと優しさを\r\nたっぷり詰め込んだ気分です♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c9ecf898a0e720d5cf8afd74ef8f33acc1792f34c64990c1172416b3d234044",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e239963105fe21672bab3743",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ビコーちゃん、お昼にも人助けを…\r\n忙しいヒーローのため、わたしも\r\nなにかお手伝いしたいです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15e3fd16b6351b873c3e3e40dec485e9fcc1d15d1ef4b45f43f16ce08fb35173",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8faa0a32fc6469d92f31cfd1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜の寮で『感動した！』と寝言が\r\n響いてきて…。夢の主はきっと、\r\n感受性が豊かで純粋な方ですね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d7a5b002959bbdaded23ca9383fb23eb49b541860cfdc136790e70717814903",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3c405e779690a35901c8ca1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "香りにもこだわりがあるんです。\r\n例えばお風呂…シャンプーとか。\r\n髪、いい匂いしませんか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0857911a11455798bc23b399968fa129163e5afe6b95b5dda6c27633560670e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59fe6caf18e6910c1d996c57",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春…淡いピンクのふんわり\r\nティアード・スカートが今の\r\nわたしのお気に入りです♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "19ad9751954e13d75b95143d186224714cacd6be82adb5642ff4acc30ee67292",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d18fbdd1cbe5341957d1efb7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏こそ辛いものを食べようと、\r\nお友だちに誘われました…き、\r\n気合いを入れて挑戦してきますっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0992ef9b392a6dc3ab018d0fbd08cbc2625b667b79ca5e5d2cfdd28fbc46d37d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9803d29197cb7f5e57ee4728",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋の色は落ち着いていて、\r\nなんだか大人になった気分を\r\n味わえちゃいますね、ふふふ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "863c8574beff36c91a7633380a25ff61ba64280e41476eae8e868c087af3b302",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1d2ef081896f3f37ed0bb72",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬は着こむことも多いので\r\nコーデにも工夫が必要ですね。\r\n悩む時間も楽しいですけど♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "82643a91d011d196b67d298283086e92ecce406f722bd8f275460662aac81062",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97854b64d436b53ddc4163e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタイン♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a921ddd0a0811eba9782f2ac778ab513f98fed247e776fdeab1dbdb7c392d24",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22beb9936e6a049944f97b78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "時々部屋でマーちゃんとモデルに\r\nなりきって撮影をするんです。\r\nいつか2人の写真集を作れるかも？",
      "source_fingerprint": "57ee650393cf3f363934d6e81b1dbbfc8736961e230f30c2290181769b75fbe2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ef1fe53f42932dcea039fbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ユキノちゃんが望むシティガール\r\nになったら…彼女だけのコーデを\r\n見つけて、プレゼントしたいです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7faa1f2e3535b2527c380b57b4c6a1678a1ecd69fbc545b885c7fa3dab85d483",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0415bd5818ecdc997e8f1acd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "バクシンオーちゃんの迷いのない\r\n走り、スピード…圧巻ですが、\r\n負けるつもりはありませんよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd616d79979dc351a976e1fca74045599d1eec813aacf468c673ca8dd7fc5bc4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6e9e9fe732f0a7c3845bf0f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お姉ちゃんは、わたしは『わたし』\r\nのままでいいと教えてくれました。\r\n…今も昔も変わらずに大好きです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "750ced99df870fc2192c7c3b8739bceb41abde7f62f16d50c43bcad097f6a6a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6ba3951967512653d52e8fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ママはスタイリストなんですよ。\r\nセンスも個性も光っていて…\r\nまだまだ追いつけない憧れです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "93161168c830cf4fb82d2a0627a2540e4537cf1137090ae8a16e973ff4391d6e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c0420df0006934e53904666",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "衣装をより魅力的に見せる\r\nためにも、ダンスはしっかり\r\nレッスンしておかないと！",
      "source_fingerprint": "edf0d0310d15dd64a9999852c3b364d5461f80ec716611eb17cb6075d05c4266",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1082",
        "91005"
      ]
    }
  ]
